{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/670058-online-|-cwod-|-crossover-world-of-darkness-gotham","id":670058,"title":"[Online | CWoD | Crossover] World of Darkness: Gotham","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-18T13:08:57-07:00","id":670058,"title":"[Online | CWoD | Crossover] World of Darkness: Gotham","content":"<br /> WoD:Gotham is a mature online chat-based role-playing game set in a Classic World of Darkness version of New York City. We work hard to make sure our chronicle is invocative and immersive.<br /> <br /> <br /> We are always looking for new players to collaborate with, to develop and share compelling and deep stories that are both entertaining and believable. You don't have to have any specific kind of experience to join us, you just have to come give it a shot. We have members who are veterans in the online community, as well as some who brand new to the game or transitioning from a table-top (and/or LARP) environment.<br /> <br /> <br /> If you are looking for a nice place to get to do some quality role-playing with intelligent, creative people then you need to check us out. This isn't your average fly-by-night RP site: we've been up and running on a stable platform and with a very competent staff for many years and have no plans of quitting that now!<br /> <br /> <br /> So take a few minutes and browse our website, <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.wodgotham.com</a> to see if we might just be what you've been looking for. Hopefully, we'll see you soon!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":7008,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7008-frank-lee","user":"Frank Lee","date":". 09-18-2015, 04:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7008-frank-lee","name":"Frank Lee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T19:11:40-07:00","id":670417,"title":"","content":"I know it's fallen down the page a bit, but:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/24720-world-of-darkness-gotham-a-classic-world-of-darkness-chat\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/24720-world-of-darkness-gotham-a-classic-world-of-darkness-chat\"> World of Darkness: Gotham - A Classic World of Darkness Chat - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/24720-world-of-darkness-gotham-a-classic-world-of-darkness-chat\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/24720-world-of-darkness-gotham-a-classic-world-of-darkness-chat </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Dear Onyx Path Publishing; We're World of Darkness: Gotham and we're seeking players and Storytellers in an engaging crossover-orientated game. You will choose from one of four venues - Vampire: the Masquerade, Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Mage: the Ascension, or Mortal. This is a world where nothing is free </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-25T10:56:30-07:00","id":677788,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the link Heavy Arms! In the last two years since that post went up, we have made many changes to our platform, our wiki, and some of our processes. With that in mind we are here to re-introduce ourselves as the bigger, better, more mature WoD: Gotham.<br /> <br /> Right now we are actively working to help players new to the game, the genre, or the medium find their way and collaborate with us. To that end I've just posted a new OOC News Article that will hopefully help direct new players to the right places to get them on their feet quickly.<br /> <br /> Come check it out, and give the Gotham Wiki another read. I think you will find that the last couple years have brought a lot of progress and while we have the same stable core of STs and players, we are growing every day!<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#2379B5\"><b><a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=89\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=89</a></b></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7008-frank-lee","name":"Frank Lee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-28T00:05:07-07:00","id":680703,"title":"","content":"Out of curiosity, what are your peak days &amp; times for activity?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-14T17:00:14-07:00","id":701417,"title":"","content":"Well that will depend a lot on the story lines going on and the time of year, but not only do we have players from all over the world - once you get Sanctioned it's pretty easy to link up with people and find RP. This is a good question to put in the forums on the website, and I am sure you will get more detail from fellow players. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> -----------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> I'd also like to remind everyone that we've had a Referral System in place for several years now, and if you want to join with a friend or two you could end up getting some sweet bonus XP out of it! See the link for details.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/forum/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?f=7&amp;t=477\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/forum/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?f=7&amp;t=477\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/forum/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?f=7&amp;t=477\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.wodgotham.com/forum/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?f=7&amp;t=477 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7008-frank-lee","name":"Frank Lee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T09:38:56-07:00","id":723369,"title":"","content":"At WoD: Gotham, we make sure our players have the tools they need to fully realize their own stories while collaborating with other players and storytellers. Curious, but not ready to invest a lot of time without really knowing what you're getting into?<br /> <br /> No problem! Check this out: <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=92\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=92</a><br /> <br /> --------------------------<br /> <br /> You are always welcome to join us on Google+, Facebook, or Twitter for the latest news and information.<br /> <br /> Google+: plus.google.com/+WoDGotham<br /> Facebook: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/WODGotham\" target=\"_blank\">www.facebook.com/WODGotham</a><br /> Twitter: twitter.com/WoDGotham","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7008-frank-lee","name":"Frank Lee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-18T21:36:45-08:00","id":811539,"title":"","content":"At WoD: Gotham, we've got an experienced and educated staff that has dedicated themselves to a mission and vision. We actively work to enable YOU to come and collaborate with other players and tell deep and interesting stories for everyone to enjoy. We make no apologies for getting rid of the people who disrupt that cohesion. Check out some of our thoughts on patience.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=93\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=93\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=93\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.wodgotham.com/newsarticle.php?newsid=93 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7008-frank-lee","name":"Frank Lee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}